 * now-card container (container: "card")
 * now-icon the event icon in the rail bubble
 * now-avatar the actor
 * now-label-value-stacked an event's details (Requestor / Reason / …)
 * now-image attachment thumbnails
 * now-text-link attachment names
 * now-button "Show more"
 * now-button-iconic close (showClose)
